info = "[center]
This is one of those things you thought of at some point but never implemented. I had the idea of element based strength and weaknesses, one of the many cores game mechanics of an RPG. Butttt after spending so much time on the base element attribute mechanic i folded, my initial idea was have opponent weak to a certain element type but i never added it in.
[/center]"
